1
00:00:00,003 --> 00:00:01,453
(Amy:)What does your card say, Bernadette?

2
00:00:01,605 --> 00:00:04,145
(Leonard:)Hang on. Do you think
we'd really drift apart

3
00:00:04,308 --> 00:00:05,908
(Leonard:)if we both became successful?

4
00:00:06,076 --> 00:00:07,346
(Penny:)Of course not.

5
00:00:07,511 --> 00:00:09,081
(Penny:)If I became a famous actress
and had to move,

6
00:00:09,246 --> 00:00:10,786
(Penny:)you would just come with me.

7
00:00:12,316 --> 00:00:14,096
(Leonard:)But if I get a chance
to be a tenured professor,

8
00:00:14,251 --> 00:00:16,701
(Leonard:)I might not have that much
choice in where I end up.

9
00:00:16,854 --> 00:00:18,594
(Penny:)Yeah, but if I become
a successful actress,

10
00:00:18,755 --> 00:00:20,255
(Penny:)we wouldn't need the money.

11
00:00:20,791 --> 00:00:22,531
(Leonard:)Well, you don't go
into science for the money.

12
00:00:22,693 --> 00:00:23,963
(Bernadette:)Speak for yourself.

13
00:00:24,128 --> 00:00:28,198
(Bernadette:)Last month, my company both invented
and cured Restless Eye Syndrome.

14
00:00:31,368 --> 00:00:33,368
(Bernadette:)Ka-Ching, ya blinky chumps.

15
00:00:36,173 --> 00:00:37,953
(Penny:)So, wait, if my career
took me somewhere else,

16
00:00:38,108 --> 00:00:39,178
(Penny:)you might not go?

17
00:00:40,811 --> 00:00:42,191
I (VOCALIZES DRAMATIC MUSIC)

18
00:00:44,281 --> 00:00:45,731
(Amy:)He started it.

19
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:48,690
(Raj:)Okay, guys, new back stories.

20
00:00:48,852 --> 00:00:51,192
(Raj:)Penny and Leonard, you two lovebirds

21
00:00:51,355 --> 00:00:54,235
(Raj:)are super successful
and living in New York.

22
00:00:54,391 --> 00:00:57,741
(Raj:)You're an actress, you're a professor
and you have three beautiful kids.

